          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 13091,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"schema\":{\"name\":\"searchrichcontent\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"meta\":{\"name\":\"urls\",\"versionKey\":5},\"data\":{\"searchRichContent\":[{\"url\":\"/pl/juice/04004\",\"title\":\"Squeeze the Savings\",\"content\":\"Fresh-squeezed by the bottle, packable pouches, natural or organic…you’re one click closer to enjoying your favorite juice! So whether you start your day with OJ or enjoy an ice-cold glass of lemonade with your meal, you’ll find exactly what you need to quench your thirst in our Juice Department.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/fresh-fruit/06111\",\"content\":\"What makes our fruit so fresh? Stricter standards, secret shoppers, temperature-controlled storage…we could go on and on. Even our farmers and suppliers are held to a higher standard! So when you pick a pear, stock up on strawberries or get a bunch of bananas, you can be sure you’re getting fruit that's fresher than fresh.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/heavy-cream/0200500002\",\"content\":\"Whip up something amazing with fresh heavy cream. From your morning coffee to perfectly whipped cake frosting, the possibilities are endless. You can even add a splash of heavy cream to soups and pasta sauces for an extra decadent finish. Find your go-to variety right here!\"},{\"url\":\"pl/protein-powders-shakes/1800100007\",\"content\":\"Whether you’re bulking up or looking to maintain a healthy weight, you’ll find a wide variety of protein powders and shakes right here. Plus, we’ve got the kids covered with delicious and nutritious shakes! So whether you add a spoonful of collagen peptides to your morning coffee, prefer a plant-based protein source or need a nutritious shake to toss into your child’s lunchbox, we have 100s of options to fit your family’s needs.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/toilet-paper/26013\",\"content\":\"It's important to have your favorite roll of tissue by your side when the time is right. From strong, double-ply 12 packs to super soft mega rolls, we have a variety of toilet paper options to choose from for all family sizes. We carry packs of toilet paper that range in size from 2 packs; when you're on the go to larger sizes like 36 and 48 packs to have extra on hand for back up or unexpected company. From 1000 sheet mega rolls that barely fit on the toiler paper holder to delicate tissue for those who prefer comfort over all else, we have options for everyone.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/diapers/10003\",\"content\":\"From preemies to pull-ups, we have your little one covered with a large selection of diapers from brands you trust. Stock up your diaper bag, stick a few in the glovebox, drop a pack off at the in-laws…it’s always best to be prepared for uh-ohs on the go! Find the style and fit that keeps your baby happy, comfortable and dry right here.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/allergy-medicine/2201200001\",\"content\":\"Ahchoo! Seasonal allergies are in bloom, and feeling better starts here. From tablets and capsules to sprays and liquids, send sniffles and sneezes packing with your go-to allergy medicine. You’ll find the right allergy medicine from brands you trust to help you feel your best…what a relief!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/bacon-breakfast-sausage/05017\",\"content\":\"Ready-to-cook or ready-to-eat, we’re stocked with so many delicious varieties of this meal must-have! From homemade biscuits and sausage gravy for breakfast to crispy bacon for a lunchtime BLT, find your favorite variety of bacon or breakfast sausage right here!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/distilled-water/0400600001\",\"content\":\"Quench your thirst with crisp, clean distilled water by the bottle, gallon or multipack. Love a little flavor in your H20? Be sure to check out our large selection of infused waters. Stock up for school, sports, celebrations and so much more!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/grapes/0611100672\",\"content\":\"Fresh grapes go with everything! Add them to your charcuterie board, toss them into chicken salad or enjoy them by the handful. With so much flavor packed into each bite, grapes are an easy way to add a burst of goodness to every meal. And with red, green and black varieties, you can add a pop of color to any meal or snack occasion.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/fluorescent-light-bulbs/2600200013\",\"content\":\"Things are starting to look brighter! You’ll find a great selection of long-lasting light bulbs right here. So you can stock up on all the fresh you crave plus household essentials in one convenient spot.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/dried-fruit/0612000001\",\"content\":\"Looking for a naturally sweet treat? Dried fruit is a great way to satisfy your sweet tooth. From medjool dates to fruit leathers and more, you’ll find convenient (and affordable) ways to sweeten up every day.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/body-oil/2100600003\",\"content\":\"Self-care starts right here. Restore moisture and radiance to your skin with a large selection of body oils from brands you trust. You’ll find cocoa, shea, coconut, avocado and more body oils to help you look your best.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/flatware-sets/2801400001\",\"content\":\"Whether you’re looking to make a statement or keep it simple, you’ll find a flatware set to fit your needs. From classic stainless steel or trendy copper, we have 100s of flatware sets that will help you serve up your next fresh meal.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/kitchen-tools-gadgets/28001\",\"content\":\"You’ve got the fresh…now find everything you need to prepare it. With spatulas, peelers, measuring cups and more all in one spot, you’ll be whipping up delicious recipes in no time at all. Find all your go-to kitchen tools and gadgets right here!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/canned-meat/0100600006\",\"content\":\"Talk about a time-saver! From chili and chicken to tuna and more, you’ll find easy and delicious ways to make your next meal. Hosting a game day celebration? Canned meat can turn any app into a crowd-pleaser.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/avocado/0611100680\",\"content\":\"From dips to sandwiches to smoothies to salads, is there anything avocados can’t do? Shop fresh, ripe avocados, available individually and in bags, and make sure to try one of our premade guacamoles for a convenient and delicious option.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/fresh-deli-meats/13001\",\"content\":\"A great sandwich starts with great ingredients, and on this page, you’ll find the sliced sandwich meats you need to build the perfect one. Shop fresh deli meats to recreate your favorite hoagie, sub or sandwich at home, or make meal prep easy and stock up on lunch meat for the week.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/ice-cream-ice-pops/19002\",\"content\":\"We make shopping for frozen treats a treat within itself! Whether you’re looking for your favorite flavor of ice cream, delicious ice cream sandwiches or fun and fruity ice pops, we have something for everyone! Explore our large selection of ice creams, frozen yogurt and frozen pops for a tasty, timeless treat.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/Cleaning-Supplies/26004\",\"content\":\"Transform your home into a sparkling oasis with our large assortment of cleaning supplies and disinfecting products. You’ll be able to keep germs at bay all year long with all-purpose cleaners, disinfecting wipes and other convenient cleaning products, all available right here!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/cleaning-supplies/26004 \",\"content\":\"Transform your home into a sparkling oasis with our large assortment of cleaning supplies and disinfecting products. You’ll be able to keep germs at bay all year long with all-purpose cleaners, disinfecting wipes and other convenient cleaning products, all available right here!\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/charcoal-fire-starters/2400100001\",\"content\":\"Whether you’re getting ready to BBQ on your charcoal grill or build s’mores next to a fresh campfire, you can get the heat going with convenient and easy fire starters. Shop charcoal, wood and other tools to help get the fire started in every situation.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/baby-formula/44008\",\"content\":\"Find the nutrition they need from the baby formula brands you trust. Explore a wide range of formula feeding options, including infant formulas for every stage, powdered formulas, specialty formulas and much more.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/cereal-granola/03001\",\"content\":\"Looking for a delicious and convenient breakfast option that’s perfect for even the busiest mornings? Whether you’re looking for something sweet, savory or a little bit of both, we have a breakfast cereal that’ll satisfy the craving. Shop classic grain cereals, granola blends, oatmeal and much, much more.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/Dry-Dog-Food/27006\",\"content\":\"Fetch your furry friend’s favorite food right here! Shop a wide variety of healthy and delicious dry dog food options for your most loyal companion, including dog kibble for puppies and adults, large breeds and small breeds, and every-buddy in-between.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/dry-dog-food/27006 \",\"content\":\"Fetch your furry friend’s favorite food right here! Shop a wide variety of healthy and delicious dry dog food options for your most loyal companion, including dog kibble for puppies and adults, large breeds and small breeds, and every-buddy in-between.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/red-wine/08120\",\"content\":\"You don’t need to be a master sommelier to find great red wines at great prices. From light and fruity to dark and complex, explore our extensive collection of cabernet sauvignon, pinot noir, merlot and popular red blends from all around the world.\"},{\"url\":\"/pl/soda-pop/04001\",\"content\":\"Pop in and satisfy your thirst with fizzy, flavorful soda pop. We’ve got you covered with all of your favorites—and must-try flavors—in cans and bottles of all sizes. Whether you’re stocking up for a party or just picking up drinks for the week, you can grab them here!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/brown+hair+dye\",\"title\":\"Brown Hair Dye\",\"content\":\"Brunettes have the most fun! Bring the salon home with brown hair dye from the most-trusted brands. You’ll have professional-looking locks at a fraction of the price. Add your favorite to your cart today!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/outdoor+decor\",\"title\":\"Outdoor Décor\",\"content\":\"The great outdoors…at great prices! From garden décor to patio must-haves, find everything you need to make your outdoor space bloom. With all the time you’ll be spending outdoors, don’t forget the citronella candles or bug spray.\"},{\"url\":\"/q/dairy+free+yogurt\",\"title\":\"Dairy-Free Yogurt\",\"content\":\"Creamy, delicious and dairy-free! Whether you prefer a soy-based snack or crave a coconut milk treat, we’re stocked with all your plant-based and vegan yogurt faves. Plain, dairy-free yogurt is a great alternative to sour cream in soups and app. Or try blending a fruit-infused coconut yogurt into your smoothie for a tasty treat!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/allergy+pills\",\"title\":\"Allergy Pills\",\"content\":\"Ahchoo! Seasonal allergies are in bloom, and feeling better starts here. From tablets and capsules to sprays and liquids, send sniffles and sneezes packing with your go-to allergy medicine. You’ll find the right allergy medicine from brands you trust to help you feel your best…what a relief!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/baby+snacks\",\"title\":\"Baby Snacks\",\"content\":\"Puffs they can pinch, pouches they can squeeze…find all the snacks they’ll love right here! Little ones can have big appetites, so keeping their gotta-have baby snacks on hand will help them (and you) stay happy. So stock up on fruit slices, yogurt melts, puffs and more today!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/dog+vitamins\",\"title\":\"Dog Vitamins\",\"content\":\"They’re our best friends, so keeping them happy and healthy is a must. Vitamins for our furry friends can help keep joints healthy, coats shiny and tails waggy! You’ll find a large selection of dog vitamins in capsules, chews and powders…all in ear-resistible flavors.\"},{\"url\":\"/q/small+coffee+maker\",\"title\":\"Small Coffee Maker\",\"content\":\"Turn your kitchen into a café without sacrificing counter space. With a small coffee maker, you can brew your favorite blend any time of day. And with so many varieties to choose from, like single-serve or multi-cup coffee makers and espresso machines, you can be your own barista in the comfort of your own home.\"},{\"url\":\"/q/birthday+party+decorations\",\"title\":\"Party Supplies & Cards\",\"content\":\"Birthdays, anniversaries or just because, you’ll find everything you need to celebrate right here. Start with the must-have party supplies, like balloons, plates, napkins and cups. Then, add gift bags, tissue paper and the perfect card. Don’t forget the cake mix, icing and candles!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/vitamins+for+kids\",\"title\":\"Vitamins for Kids\",\"content\":\"Daily vitamins can help keep kids healthy all year long. From vitamin D drops and chewable multivitamins to sleep aids and more, you’re sure to find the right variety to support your growing child. And with so many flavors to choose from, kids will love making vitamins part of their daily routine!\"},{\"url\":\"/q/self+tanning+lotion\",\"title\":\"Self-Tanning Lotion\",\"content\":\"Get a sun-kissed glow without going to the beach! Self-tanning lotions are simple to use and can help you gradually achieve a natural-looking tan. Simply find the self-tanning lotion that best matches your skin tone, from light to dark brown, and follow the instructions for beachy results. And you find several varieties to choose from, including lotions, sprays and wipes.\"}]}}"
          },
