 your deli favorites with Hillshire Farm® Ultra Thin Oven Roasted Turkey Breast and Honey Ham Sliced Deli Lunch Meat. Perfect for sandwiches and wraps, our deli sliced turkey breast lunchmeat is paired with sliced ham lunch meat for a delicious combination of sweet and savory. Made with no artificial flavors, Hillshire Farm deli meat is juicy, flavorful and 96 to 98% fat free.</p><ul><li>One 16 oz package of Hillshire Farm Ultra Thin Oven Roasted Turkey Breast and Honey Ham Sliced Deli Lunch Meat</li><li>Includes one pouch of deli turkey breast and one pouch of pre sliced deli ham</li><li>Hillshire Farm deli meat is juicy, flavorful and 96 to 98% fat free</li><li>Our sandwich deli meat has no artificial flavors</li><li>Turkey breast and sliced honey ham lunchmeat is fully cooked and ready to eat</li><li>Hillshire Farm lunch meat has a double sealed package for absolute freshness</li><li>Keep this deli meat refrigerated</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"hillshire-farm-ultra-thin-sliced-lunchmeat-oven-roasted-turkey-breast-honey-ham\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/hillshire-farm-ultra-thin-sliced-lunchmeat-oven-roasted-turkey-breast-honey-ham/0004450032980\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":false,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00008\",\"name\":\"Packaged Variety Packs\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0004450032980\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"1.0 [lb_av]\"},\"price\":{},\"nutrition\":{\"allergens\":\"May contain Wheat and Their Derivatives.\",\"components\":[{\"footers\":[],\"headers\":[],\"footnotes\":[],\"preparationStates\":[{\"description\":\"Unprepared\",\"nutriFacts\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"g\",\"dailyValue\":\"5\",\"precision\":\"Approximately\",\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"value\"