ree ham with no artificial flavors and no nitrates or nitrites added.◊ Touched with a delicious honey sweetness, have this convenient, fully cooked deli ham anytime of the day.</p><p>◊Except those naturally occurring in celery powder and sea salt.</p><p>Kroger® products are tried, tested and loved by you - quality guaranteed.</p><ul><li>9 oz Tub of Kroger® Honey Ham Uncured Deli Thin Sliced</li><li>97% fat free, fully cooked, and thin sliced for whenever hunger strikes</li><li>Ideal for crafting sandwiches, wraps, or using as a salad topping</li><li>Gluten free with no artificial flavors for pure savoriness; resealable tub helps maintain freshness</li><li>Kroger® quality you can trust</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"kroger-honey-ham-uncured-deli-thin-sliced\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/kroger-honey-ham-uncured-deli-thin-sliced/0001111097802\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":true,\"tareValue\":0,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00005\",\"name\":\"Packaged Ham\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0001111097802\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"0.56 [lb_av]\"},\"location\":{\"locations\":[{\"aisle\":{\"description\":\"MEAT\",\"number\":\"101\",\"side\":\"R\"},\"bayInAisle\":\"26\",\"numOfFacings\":\"1\",\"physicalShelfNumber\":\"4\",\"shelfPositionInBay\":\"5\"}]},\"price\":{\"displayTemplate\":\"EveryDayLowPrice\",\"orderBy\":\"Unit\",\"sellBy\":\"Unit\",\"storePrices\":{\"regular\":{\"defaultDescription\":\"$3.99\",\"expirationDate\":{\"value\":\"9999-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"nfor\":1,\"nforPrice\":\"USD 3.99\",\"unitPrice\":\"USD 3.99\",\"price\":\"USD 3.99\",\"equivalizedUnitPrice\":{\"amount\":\"44.33\",\"denomination\":\"CENT\",\"unit\":\"PER OUNCE\"},\"equivalizedUnitP