ed with premium ingredients for an amazing eating experience</li><li>*Except those naturally occurring in cultured celery juice and sea salt</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"private-selection-maple-off-the-bone-uncured-deli-ham-sliced\",\"serviceCounter\":\"Deli Counter\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/private-selection-maple-off-the-bone-uncured-deli-ham-sliced/0023576140000\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":false,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"001\",\"name\":\"Fresh Deli Meats\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"13\",\"name\":\"Deli\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00002\",\"name\":\"Fresh Deli Ham Meat\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0023576140000\",\"verified\":true},\"price\":{\"displayTemplate\":\"WhiteTag\",\"orderBy\":\"Weight\",\"sellBy\":\"Weight\",\"storePrices\":{\"regular\":{\"defaultDescription\":\"$9.99/lb\",\"expirationDate\":{\"value\":\"9999-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"nfor\":1,\"nforPrice\":\"USD 9.99\",\"unitPrice\":\"USD 9.99\",\"price\":\"USD 9.99\",\"equivalizedUnitPrice\":{\"amount\":\"9.99\",\"denomination\":\"DOLLAR\",\"unit\":\"PER POUND\"}},\"sourceLocationId\":\"03500577\",\"sellerId\":\"KR001\",\"sellerName\":\"Kroger\"}},\"nutrition\":{\"allergens\":\"Contains Celery and its Derivatives. Free from Cereals and Their Derivatives.\",\"components\":[{\"footers\":[],\"headers\":[],\"footnotes\":[],\"preparationStates\":[{\"description\":\"Unspecified\",\"nutriFacts\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"mg\",\"dailyValue\":\"2\",\"name\":\"Iron\",\"value\":\"0.4\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"g\",\"dailyValue\":\"0\",\"name\":\"Dietary Fiber\",\"value\":\"0\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"mcg\",\"dailyValue\":\"0\",\"name\":\"Vitamin D\",\"value\":\"0.2\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"mg\",\"dailyValue\":\"10\",\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"value\":\"30\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"mg\",\"dailyValue\":\"8\",\"name\":\"Potassium\",\"value\":\"