st Off the Bone Deli Ham Sliced is a cut above the rest. This package is chockful of deli ham that's bursting with flavor and is 97% fat free with no nitrates or nitrites addedˆ. Every mouthful takes you on a ham-centric culinary journey. Dive into this delicious off-the-bone black forest ham that redefines at-home meal-making.</p><p>Private Selection® - Elevate every occasion.</p><p>ˆExcept those naturally occurring in cultured celery juice powder.</p><ul><li>8 oz Tub of Private Selection® Black Forest Off the Bone Deli Ham Sliced</li><li>Off-the-bone cut in a resealable package, great for a delicious, homemade sandwich</li><li>Embrace a culinary experience with this deli meat that's 97% fat free, and so good you won't believe you're at home</li><li>Perfect for elevating everyday meals, from lunchtime paninis to breakfast scrambles</li><li>Crafted with premium ingredients for an amazing eating experience</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"private-selection-black-forest-off-the-bone-deli-ham-sliced\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/private-selection-black-forest-off-the-bone-deli-ham-sliced/0001111062877\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":true,\"tareValue\":0,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00005\",\"name\":\"Packaged Ham\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0001111062877\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"0.5 [lb_av]\"},\"location\":{\"locations\":[{\"aisle\":{\"description\":\"DELI\",\"number\":\"103\",\"side\":\"R\"},\"bayInAisle\":\"5\",\"numOfFacings\":\"1\",\"physicalShelfNumber\":\"5\",\"shelfPositionInBay\":\"5\"},{\"aisle\":{\"description\":\"DELI\",\"number\":\"103\",\"side\":\"R\"},\"bayInAisle\":\"5\",\"numOfFacings\":\"1\",\"physicalShelfNumber\":\"5\",\"shelfPositionInBay\":\"6\"}]},\