 of sweet, succulent flavors worthy of delight. The subtle integration of wildflower honey, water, sugar, and salt escalates its flavor, while a touch of vinegar helps preserve this tasty sliced ham. 97% fat free with no nitrates or nitrites addedˆ, this deli meat is the perfect addition to a classic ham and Swiss sandwich. Dive into this rich, juicy experience, your taste buds will surely thank you.</p><p>Private Selection® - Elevate every occasion. </p><p>ˆExcept those naturally occurring in cultured celery juice powder.</p><ul><li>8 oz Tub of Private Selection® Uncured Wildflower Honey Deli Ham Sliced</li><li>Bursting with the sweet flavor of wildflower honey</li><li>Perfectly sliced deli meat for delightful additions to sandwiches or as a savory addition to charcuterie boards</li><li>97% fat free ham with sugar and salt to enhance the classic flavor</li><li>Crafted with premium ingredients for an amazing eating experience</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"private-selection-uncured-wildflower-honey-deli-ham-sliced\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/private-selection-uncured-wildflower-honey-deli-ham-sliced/0001111062876\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":true,\"tareValue\":0,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00005\",\"name\":\"Packaged Ham\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0001111062876\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"0.5 [lb_av]\"},\"location\":{\"locations\":[{\"aisle\":{\"description\":\"DELI\",\"number\":\"103\",\"side\":\"R\"},\"bayInAisle\":\"5\",\"numOfFacings\":\"1\",\"physicalShelfNumber\":\"5\",\"shelfPositionInBay\":\"7\"}]},\"price\":{\"displayTemplate\":\"YellowTag\",\"offerCode\":\"118946\",\"orderBy\":\"Unit\",\"sellBy\":\"Unit\",\"storePrices\":{\"promo\":{\"defaultDescriptio