r perfectly seasoned, thinly sliced ham lunch meat is carefully crafted with the highest quality ingredients.</p><ul><li>One 9 oz pack of Hillshire Farm Ultra Thin Sliced Black Forest Ham Sandwich Meat</li><li>Hillshire Farm Ultra Thin Black Forest Ham lunch meat is carefully crafted with the highest quality ingredients</li><li>Our farmhouse quality ham is slow roasted for hours and sliced ultra-thin</li><li>Hillshire Farm ham cold cuts contain no artificial preservatives or flavors</li><li>No nitrates or nitrites added* *Except for those naturally occurring in the celery juice powder and sea salt</li><li>Our fully cooked sandwich ham is gluten-free</li><li>Contains 9 grams of protein per serving</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"hillshire-farm-ultra-thin-sliced-black-forest-ham-deli-lunch-meat\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/hillshire-farm-ultra-thin-sliced-black-forest-ham-deli-lunch-meat/0004450032953\",\"shipsWithColdPack\":false,\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":true,\"tareValue\":0,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00005\",\"name\":\"Packaged Ham\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0004450032953\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"0.56 [lb_av]\"},\"location\":{\"locations\":[{\"aisle\":{\"description\":\"MEAT\",\"number\":\"101\",\"side\":\"R\"},\"bayInAisle\":\"25\",\"numOfFacings\":\"2\",\"physicalShelfNumber\":\"3\",\"shelfPositionInBay\":\"1\"}]},\"price\":{\"displayTemplate\":\"EveryDayLowPrice\",\"orderBy\":\"Unit\",\"sellBy\":\"Unit\",\"storePrices\":{\"regular\":{\"defaultDescription\":\"$4.99\",\"expirationDate\":{\"value\":\"9999-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"nfor\":1,\"nforPrice\":\"USD 4.99\",\"unitPrice\":\"USD 4.99\",\"price\":\"USD 4.99\",\"equivalizedUnitPrice\":{\