tains no added MSG.</p><ul><li>One 2 oz pouch of Buddig Honey Ham Lunch Meat</li><li>Enjoy the savory flavor of smoked ham slices with this delicious ham lunch meat for breakfast, lunch, dinner or anytime hunger hits</li><li>Black Forest deli ham sliced meat is great on sandwiches, low carb wraps, chopped on salads for lunches or on its own for easy snacking</li><li>Gluten free sliced ham lunchmeat with 9 grams of protein and 90 calories per serving for satisfying and flavorful meals and low carb snacks</li><li>Try all Buddig 2 oz single serve lunch meats to find your favorite; keep ham sandwich meat refrigerated</li><li>Carl Buddig and Company - Family owned since 1943</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"buddig-black-forest-ham-lunch-meat-2oz\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/buddig-black-forest-ham-lunch-meat-2oz/0007740012123\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":false,\"tareValue\":0,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"013\",\"name\":\"Lunchmeat & Packaged Deli Meat\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"05\",\"name\":\"Meat & Seafood\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00005\",\"name\":\"Packaged Ham\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0007740012123\",\"verified\":true,\"weight\":\"0.12 [lb_av]\"},\"price\":{},\"nutrition\":{\"allergens\":\"Free from Cereals and Their Derivatives.\",\"components\":[{\"footers\":[],\"headers\":[],\"footnotes\":[],\"preparationStates\":[{\"description\":\"Unspecified\",\"nutriFacts\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"kcal\",\"dailyValue\":\"0\",\"name\":\"Calories\",\"value\":\"90\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"g\",\"dailyValue\":\"8\",\"name\":\"Total Fat\",\"value\":\"5\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"g\",\"dailyValue\":\"0\",\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"mg\",\"dailyValue\":\"12\",\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"value\":\"35\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"kcal\",\"dailyValue\":\"0\",\"name\":\"Calories from Fat\",\"value\":\"45\"},