:7},\"romanceDescription\":\"<p>Private Selection® Cherry Wood Smoked Deli Ham Sliced combines gourmet appeal with at-home convenience. This succulent cherry wood smoked ham boasts an authentic, rich flavor and is 96% fat free. Perfect for elevating sandwiches, charcuterie boards, or simply snacking, it's a hassle-free and flexible deli meat. With no nitrates or nitrites addedˆ, experience the thrill of premium ham at your own table with this sumptuously smoked selection.</p><p>•If you would like a different amount than 1 lb, please leave the exact amount and your preferred thickness in the comments of your digital order.</p><p>Private Selection® - Elevate every occasion.</p><p>ˆExcept those naturally occurring in cultured celery juice and sea salt.</p><ul><li>1 lb of Private Selection® Cherry Wood Smoked Deli Ham Sliced</li><li>Artfully smoked ham over sweet cherry wood for a flavorful taste and tantalizing aroma</li><li>A deli meat with rich, smoky taste, it elevates any sandwich or salad</li><li>Ham that's 96% fat free and with no nitrates or nitrites addedˆ</li><li>Crafted with premium ingredients for an amazing eating experience</li><li>ˆExcept those naturally occurring in cultured celery juice and sea salt</li></ul>\",\"salesChannelCode\":\"STORE\",\"salesChannelName\":\"Store\",\"seoDescription\":\"private-selection-cherry-wood-smoked-deli-ham-sliced\",\"serviceCounter\":\"Deli Counter\",\"shareLink\":\"https://www.kroger.com/p/private-selection-cherry-wood-smoked-deli-ham-sliced/0027576450000\",\"snapEligible\":true,\"soldInStore\":false,\"taxGroupCode\":\"PF050001\",\"taxonomies\":[{\"commodity\":{\"code\":\"001\",\"name\":\"Fresh Deli Meats\"},\"department\":{\"code\":\"13\",\"name\":\"Deli\"},\"subCommodity\":{\"code\":\"00002\",\"name\":\"Fresh Deli Ham Meat\"}}],\"temperatureIndicator\":\"55688103655\",\"upc\":\"0027576450000\",\"verified\":true},\"price\":{\"displayTemplate\":\"WhiteTag\",\"orderBy\":\"Weight\",\"sellBy\":\"Weight\",\"storePrices\":{\"